	(text "Watchdog comparator breakout for Rev A rework (Daniel's units), Set A values.\nIN+ = ENV_THRESHOLD node on Rev A (R30 = R31 = 470k stay on the main board).\nVref = V_LOGIC x R2/(R1+R2) = 2.5 x 30k/250k = 0.30 V\nTrip (ENV_HOLD) = Vref x (1 + R30/R31 + R30/R3) = 0.30 x (1 + 1 + 0.1) = 0.63 V\nRelease (ENV_HOLD) = Trip - V_LOGIC x R30/R3 = 0.63 - 0.25 = 0.38 V   (calculated; TLV7011 internal hyst. shifts each by ~4 mV)\nSet B: R2 = 20k, R3 = 10M (trip 0.43 V, release 0.31 V).  Set B+: R2 = 20k, R5 = trimmer wired across its pads (Rb = R2 + R5).\nTLV7021 (open-drain): fit R4 100k pull-up.  C3 (DNP): optional IN+ filter if the wire picks up hum, ~1 nF.\nJ1 = JST SH 6-pin right angle (SM06B-SRSS-TB); all SMD, flat bottom for VHB.  Rb = R2 + R5: two 0603s in series, swap either to tune.\nRev A hookup: cut AUDIO_DETECT between U7.2 and U8.9; J1.2 (DET) -> U8.9 / TP8 side.\nJ1.3 (THR) -> ENV_THRESHOLD (R30/R31 junction).  J1.4 (VL) -> V_LOGIC at C26.  J1.1 (GND) -> U8.7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 85.09 151.892 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f1c2a1e-0000-4000-8000-000000000131")
	)
